  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Oxfam to increase  access to sanitation in Equateur Province through the piloting of a sanitation marketing approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to Oxfam to increase  access to sanitation in Equateur Province through the piloting of a sanitation marketing approach is a component of Increasing sustainable access to water sanitation and hygiene in the Democratic Republic of Congo reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;1,750,967. It works in the following sector(s): Basic sanitation, Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development.</narrative>
